=== hard_line ===
Contentious season. Procurement's budget tightens to $3.50/lb, Sustainability demands at least half the order certified, Supply Risk caps any origin at 40%, and every stakeholder lowers its bar by only 0.02 a round. A deal all four accept still exists, but it takes a long negotiation to find.

